This '''species''' was a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that existed in [[the galaxy]]. "[[Doctor Mandible]]" was a member of this species.<ref name="Chapter 5" />

==Biology and appearance==
This [[Color|brown]] [[ant]]-like [[insectoid]] [[species]] was distinguished by their large size and features, including a pair of mandibles, a pair of [[Antennapalps|antennae]], glowing orange [[eye]]s, and multiple segmented [[limb]].<ref name="Chapter 5" />

==Species in the galaxy==
By [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|5}}</ref> a member of this species nicknamed "[[Doctor Mandible]]"  was living on the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Tatooine]], becoming a regular at [[Chalmun's Spaceport Cantina]] in the [[city]] of [[Mos Eisley]].<ref name="Chapter 5" />

==Behind the scenes==
This species first appeared in the [[Chapter 5: The Gunslinger|fifth episode]] of the [[2019]] television series, [[Star Wars: The Mandalorian|''The Mandalorian]],'' directed by [[Dave Filoni]].<ref name="Chapter 5" />

